---
alwaysApply: true
---
Outputs policy:

- `outputs/` is generated-only (untracked by git)
- `results/` is committed (curated, publication-ready)
- all generated artifacts go under `outputs/<analysis_name>/`
- never commit raw analysis outputs

Every saved artifact must include metadata:
- random seed used
- package version
- key parameters (preset stage, grid size, etc.)
- timestamp

Use `save_with_version()` from `src/analysis/common.py` for all pickle outputs.
